sewers
abandoned tower


-- classes
Blacksmith - forge armor/weapon
Sorcerer - ritual scribing (long casting but free)
Monk - fist & all weapon skill - weight 0, speed 5, damage 3
Scout - run/jump cost 0
Witch - charm
Summoner - summon perma 1
Necromancer - raise dead
Hexer - cause buff
Rogue - hiding
Warrior - blocking free

-- powers (per encounter)
move terrain - inf
control target - 1
mistform - 1
time travel - save current data, load after 100 turns - 1
teleport - teleport to any coordinate - inf
telekinesis - move target prop/unit - inf
touch of gold - depends on yellow in sprite. 1
mending - repair equipment

-- specials
poison immunity
fire immunity
bleed immunity
stun immunity

-- artifacts
memory amulet - remembers location it was put on
eel trident - gains charge over time, hits 100% when 100 charge
dying dagger - instant kill if hits, destroyed if not
lifegem amulet - auto regens to 3 durability every encounter
bloodgem amulet - regens to 3 durability by absorbing corpses
interdimensional coin - spawn random item
ancient potion - perm inc str/agi